### subshell compares one to two with a redirection
( 1 > 2 )
>>> SC2210 1:5

### stdout redirected to a file literally named 2
logger 1>2
>>> SC2210 1:9

### appending to a numeric file name
printf '%s\n' "$summary" >> 404
>>> SC2154 1:16
>>> SC2210 1:26

### reading from a numeric file name
sort < 2024
>>> SC2210 1:6

### clobbering into a numeric file name
set -C
date >| 7
>>> SC2210 2:6

### quoted numeric target is intentional
backup_tool > '2'
>>> none

### fd duplication to stderr is fine
echo "disk almost full" >&2
>>> none
